# Core decisions (74 cases, Spanish content, English labels). One JSON object per line.
# routing: task -> light | default | deep. search: query + previous -> cut | cheap | full.
# triage: purpose + page -> keep | drop. citation: claim + section -> supported | contradicted | unsupported.
# Material: two real investigations (defamation litigation in the Dominican Republic 2020-2026;
# 2026 earthquakes in Mexico and Colombia). Natural persons are pseudonymized; institutions,
# laws and case numbers are public records and kept. Labels by one annotator.
